  "sourceTitle": "Baby Spinach, Blueberry and Wheatgrass Smoothie",
  "sourceText": "Baby Spinach, Blueberry and Wheatgrass Smoothie\nBy: Matt\nPublished: Monday, January 2, 2017 - 8:20am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 small apple\n1 cup baby spinach\n1 large banana\n1 cup blueberries\n1 tsp wheat grass powder\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend all the ingredients together with as much water and ice as you like and serve.\n\nAbout\n\nalkalizing blueberry and spinach smoothie with chlorophyll, antioxidants and vitamins to boost immunity",
